[ti:Unknown]\n[ar:Unknown]\n[by:AutoLyrics]\n[00:00.00] Love me tender,\n[00:09.12] love me sweet,\n[00:13.12] never let me go.\n[00:19.68] You have made my life complete,\n[00:26.24] and I love you so and\n[00:54.10] I always will.\n[01:00.00] Love me tender,\n[01:02.94] love me long,\n[01:06.14] take me to your heart.\n[01:12.64] For it's there that I belong,\n[01:19.50] and we'll never part.\n[01:26.54] Love me tender,\n[01:30.16] love me dear.\n[01:33.46] Tell me you are mine.\n[01:39.96] I'll be yours through all the\n[01:44.80] years,\n[01:46.32] till the end of time.\n[01:52.90] When at last my dreams come\n[01:57.86] true,\n[01:59.72] darling this I know.\n[02:06.72] Happiness will follow you everywhere you\n[02:16.20] go.\n